questions.text:
What is the expected RTL synthesis output of the following piece of RTL code?
module top(a, b, c, s, en, out1, out2);
	input a, b, c, s, en;
	output out1, out2;
	reg out1, out2;

	always @(*) begin
	 if (s==1'b0)
		out1 = a;
	 else
		out1 = b;
	end

	always @(*) begin
	 if (en==1'b1)
		out2 = c;
 	end
endmodule

